    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέσμ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>binding</i>: metaph.,
				<i>binding as with a spell, enchaining,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕμνος ἐξ Ἐρινύων δ. φρενῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					332
				</span></i>
			(lyr.), cf.<i><span class="en">
				306
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>bound, captive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				608
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				226
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				580
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; <i>on leash,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύων</span>] prob. in Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				31.32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. φυγών,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δεσμῶν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				792
			</span></i>.</div>
